norm{e^*}_1, \end{equation} which implies  egin{equation*} \lambda 
norm{\wt{e}}_1 \leq 2 
norm{e^* - \wt{e}}_{1} 
norm{\wt{\eps}/\sqrt{n}}_{\infty} + \lambda 
norm{e^*}_1, \end{equation*} and in turn  egin{align*} \lambda 
