norm{ eta^*}_2\sqrt{2\pi}}, \end{equation} whenever $\gamma <  rac{3}{\sqrt{2}} 
norm{ eta^*}_2$, otherwise $p > .86$ as can be verified by evaluating the Gaussian cumulative distribution function numerically. 
oindent Let $\mathcal{B}:=\left\{-\dfrac{\gamma}{\sqrt{2}}<\x^	op eta^*<\dfrac{\gamma}{\sqrt{2}}ight\}$. For 	extit{i.i.d.} observations $\x_1,\ldots,\x_n$, let \[ u:=\sum_{i=1}^n \mathbb{I}(\x_i\in \mathcal{B})\sim 	ext{binom}(n, p), \] with $p$ as defined in \eqref{eq:ap1}. The event $\mathcal{A}_{\gamma}$ in \eqref{eq:Agamma} occurs whenever at least two $\x_i, \x_j\in \mathcal{B}$, i.e., the event $\left\{u\ge 2ight\}\subseteq\mathcal{A}_{\gamma}$. Let us suppose for the moment that $p \geq 3.5/n$ for $n\ge 5$. Then  egin{align*} \p\left(\mathcal{A}_{\gamma}ight)&\ge\p\left(u\ge 2ight)\ &\geq 1-\left(1-\dfrac{3.5}{n}ight)^{n}-n\left(\dfrac{3.5}{n}ight)\left(1-\dfrac{3.5}{n}ight)^{n-1}\ &>.85 \quad 	ext{for $n\ge 5$}. \end{align*} Using Eq.\eqref{eq:ap1}, we now conclude that $\p\left(\mathcal{A}_{\gamma}ight)\ge .85$ whenever $\dfrac{\gamma}{\| eta^*\|_2 \sqrt{2\pi}}\ge 3.5/n$. This holds if \[ \| eta^*\|_2^2 \le \dfrac{1}{25\pi}n^2 \gamma^2. \]

